  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Saneamiento Universal de Ciudades Tursticas y Costeras</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universal Sanitation Program in Coastal and Tourist Cities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es mejorar las condiciones ambientales y la salud de los habitantes de las localidades beneficiadas por el programa a travs del acceso a servicios de saneamiento gestionados de manera sostenible y segura. Los objetivos especficos del programa son: (i) incrementar la cobertura del saneamiento gestionando de manera segura en las localidades intervenidas por el programa; y (ii) mejorar la gestin de los servicios de agua potable en las localidades intervenidas por el programa y contribuir al fortalecimiento de los operadores de AyS y del INAPA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to improve the environmental conditions and health of the inhabitants of the localities benefited by the program through access to sanitation services managed in a sustainable and safe manner. The specific objectives of the program are: (i) to increase the coverage of sanitation services managed in a safe manner in the localities served by the program; and (ii) to improve the management of drinking water services in the localities served by the program and contribute to the strengthening of the WS operators and INAPA.</narrative>
  </description>
